y'S' - SECTION MONSTER INFORMATION

b   EACH DUNGEON IS DEVIDED INTO
FIVE SECTIONS, EACH CONTROLLED BY
A SMALL GROUP OF MONSTERS. HIT 'S'
TO FIND OUT ABOUT THE TYPES OF
MONSTERS NORMALLY FOUND IN THE
CURRENT SECTION OF THE DUNGEON.
THIS WILL HELP YOU TO KNOW WHICH
MONSTERS TO FIGHT AND WHICH TO RUN
FROM.

r   THE SHADOW MONSTER WILL ALWAYS
APPEAR ON THE LEFT SIDE OF THIS
SCREEN. THIS MONSTER WILL HAVE A
VERY POWERFUL AND USEFUL ITEM IF
YOU CAN SUCCESSFULLY FIND AND
DEFEAT IT!

